<div class="email-container">
  <div class="email-card">
    <div class="email-header">
      <h1 class="email-title">重置密码</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="email-body">
      <p class="email-text">您好，</p>

      <p class="email-text">我们收到了重置 <strong><%= @user.email %></strong> 账号密码的请求。点击下方按钮设置新密码：</p>

      <div class="email-button-container">
        <%= link_to "重置我的密码", edit_identity_password_reset_url(sid: @signed_id), class: "email-button" %>
      </div>

      <div class="email-alert">
        <p class="email-alert-text">此链接 <strong>20 分钟</strong>内有效。如果您没有发起重置密码的请求，可以忽略此邮件，您的账号是安全的。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="email-divider">

      <p class="email-footer">如有疑问，请直接回复此邮件联系我们。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
